{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X部分感受提示使用了“马祖卡味”“F小调”“八度”等偏专业的音乐术语，普通观众可能需要停下来理解，反而打断听音乐；Y的部分表达更口语、直观。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把叙事拆成更容易扫读的短句，并用【】突出每段心理变化的关键，让观众不必读完所有文字就能抓住人物当下的处境和选择。更重要的是，感受提示与音乐节点同步出现，能具体呈现从怀念、压抑、动摇、孤独到重新站稳的细微变化，使人物的心理动机和整首曲子的情绪发展形成连续对应。Y的叙事也清楚，但右侧感受词容易形成一堆需要同时处理的信息，音乐与文字的时间对应关系也不如X鲜明。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "115eb341-51d5-4571-bdf9-0ca0090724d1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T165114265836Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.109, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:52:00.382277+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "46cf24a181e0a3d7aa003b050831d340fb35f67427d920f15adb223add85b137", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "to